      47.87,
      451.99,
      542.39,
      487.06
    ],
    "text": "I, Sunil Kumara Gamage, Minister of Youth Affairs and Sports, in terms of the powers vested in me under Sections 32 and 33 of the Sports Law, No. 25 of 1973, as amended, do hereby amend the Extraordinary Gazette Notification bearing No. 2437/32 published on 22nd May 2025 as follows.",
