    "bbox": [
      47.87,
      497.99,
      542.4,
      533.06
    ],
    "text": "1. The composition of the WORKING TASK FORCE appointed under paragraph 3 of the Extraordinary Gazette Notification bearing No. 2437/32 published on 22nd May 2025 notification is hereby amended and the following members are appointed to the WORKING TASK FORCE :",
